01:18:47,660 --> 01:18:48,860
<i>if left untreated.</i>

1252
01:18:51,160 --> 01:18:54,200
I'm told that the eye is
the fastest healing organ

1253
01:18:54,360 --> 01:18:56,360
in the body, so
hopefully that's true.

1254
01:18:57,360 --> 01:19:00,059
Um, and so, I'm just
gonna kind of baby it,

1255
01:19:00,060 --> 01:19:03,500
and hopefully in a few
days, I'm just back to normal.

1256
01:19:07,860 --> 01:19:09,859
Teal's been great as a partner,

1257
01:19:09,860 --> 01:19:11,159
but I'm really
worried about Teal,

1258
01:19:11,160 --> 01:19:12,300
to be honest with you.

1259
01:19:13,560 --> 01:19:15,000
I'm hoping it's not
gonna be too bad.

1260
01:19:15,160 --> 01:19:16,500
I'm hoping it's
gonna fix itself,

1261
01:19:16,660 --> 01:19:20,000
because, to be in such
a dangerous environment

1262
01:19:20,160 --> 01:19:22,659
with something that's
gonna impede her vision,

1263
01:19:22,660 --> 01:19:24,400
that could be really bad news.

1264
01:19:55,860 --> 01:19:58,500
OK, I just woke up and...

1265
01:20:00,160 --> 01:20:04,800
...something big
is outside right now.

1266
01:20:06,100 --> 01:20:09,360
And it literally just
hit this car next to me.

1267
01:20:09,530 --> 01:20:10,560
Hey.

1268
01:20:11,560 --> 01:20:12,460
Hey.

1269
01:20:12,461 --> 01:20:15,100
Something... something
big is out there.

1270
01:20:17,660 --> 01:20:19,460
Hey!

1271
01:20:21,400 --> 01:20:22,760
Get!

1272
01:20:26,600 --> 01:20:29,900
2 To get more accurate here,
I'm gonna need to build a range,

1273
01:20:30,060 --> 01:20:33,000
make sure that when I get
a chance, when an animal

1274
01:20:33,160 --> 01:20:35,859
does come in range,
that it's not getting away.

1275
01:20:35,860 --> 01:20:38,459
All right, I'm trying to
mark the distance I think it is

1276
01:20:38,460 --> 01:20:41,990
from my shelter to here
that would match the 25 yards

1277
01:20:42,000 --> 01:20:45,460
from my blind to the edge
of the water on the other side.

1278
01:20:45,630 --> 01:20:48,560
So, if I can get
accurate at this distance,

1279
01:20:48,730 --> 01:20:49,930
then that's all I really need.

1280
01:20:51,260 --> 01:20:54,160
All right, this guy
is a perfect target.

1281
01:20:55,460 --> 01:20:56,900
I mean, he looks like an animal,

1282
01:20:58,000 --> 01:21:02,000
was an animal, and the core
is all styrofoam, so it can take

1283
01:21:02,160 --> 01:21:03,360
so many arrows.

1284
01:21:08,160 --> 01:21:10,300
Ah! Too high.

1285
01:21:10,460 --> 01:21:11,500
Coming in high.

1286
01:21:13,960 --> 01:21:15,060
Toast.

1287
01:21:15,230 --> 01:21:16,590
I'm feeling pretty
good about that.

1288
01:21:19,000 --> 01:21:20,160
Two out of two.

1289
01:21:23,160 --> 01:21:24,300
Donezo!

1290
01:21:27,730 --> 01:21:29,260
2 Hey! Hey! Hey!

1291
01:21:34,860 --> 01:21:36,660
Hey! Hey!

1292
01:21:38,460 --> 01:21:39,560
Get!

1293
01:21:46,360 --> 01:21:48,259
Oh, my god.

1294
01:21:48,260 --> 01:21:49,560
Ooh!

1295
01:22:10,160 --> 01:22:12,560
I'm up for a minute
or two, just 'cause

1296
01:22:13,660 --> 01:22:17,300
the smoke was starting
to bother my eye again.

1297
01:22:18,960 --> 01:22:20,060
It hurts.

1298
01:22:21,160 --> 01:22:25,000
My eye is... now swollen
