1299
01:22:54,960 --> 01:22:57,160
Yay!

1300
01:23:18,660 --> 01:23:22,300
Made this nifty-difty eye patch.

1301
01:23:24,160 --> 01:23:27,759
Last night was excruciating.

1302
01:23:27,760 --> 01:23:30,990
I contemplated calling
the medics several times

1303
01:23:31,000 --> 01:23:32,659
during the night.

1304
01:23:32,660 --> 01:23:35,900
The whole side of
my face was throbbing.

1305
01:23:36,060 --> 01:23:38,090
My pulse was through the roof.

1306
01:23:38,100 --> 01:23:39,160
It was not good.

1307
01:23:39,330 --> 01:23:40,500
Oh.

1308
01:23:41,500 --> 01:23:44,060
<i>Concerned about
Teal's eye injury,</i>

1309
01:23:44,230 --> 01:23:46,760
