1310
01:23:48,260 --> 01:23:50,200
You want me to come out?

1311
01:23:50,360 --> 01:23:51,360
Oh!

1312
01:23:51,430 --> 01:23:52,290
You OK?

1313
01:23:52,300 --> 01:23:54,100
Yeah, it just hurts a lot again.

1314
01:23:57,460 --> 01:23:59,260
Yeah, it just hurts.

1315
01:24:15,500 --> 01:24:17,000
Yeah.

1316
01:24:17,160 --> 01:24:19,260
Yeah, it's like a
real stab, stabbing.

1317
01:24:23,600 --> 01:24:24,660
OK, look up.

1318
01:24:25,760 --> 01:24:27,500
I had a look at Teal's eye.

1319
01:24:27,660 --> 01:24:30,559
It was extremely red,
especially around the sclera,

1320
01:24:30,560 --> 01:24:32,100
