And her eyelids were
also quite inflamed, as well.

1322
01:24:35,430 --> 01:24:37,900
Can you see the
cut? Is it on the iris?

1323
01:24:38,060 --> 01:24:39,600
-Yeah, just on the iris.
-Oh.

1324
01:24:39,760 --> 01:24:42,459
We are increasingly concerned
that infection will step in

1325
01:24:42,460 --> 01:24:44,090
in the eye.

1326
01:24:44,100 --> 01:24:46,500
So we're gonna
clean it out first.

1327
01:24:46,660 --> 01:24:47,759
-You OK?
-Yeah.

1328
01:24:47,760 --> 01:24:49,960
-It's hard to keep it open.
-Yeah.

1329
01:24:50,130 --> 01:24:53,100
<i>To help prevent infection,
medics will flush Teal's eye</i>

1330
01:24:53,260 --> 01:24:55,200
<i>with an antibiotic solution.</i>

1331
01:24:55,360 --> 01:24:57,759
<i>But if her symptoms
worsen, they'll be forced</i>

1332
01:24:57,760 --> 01:24:59,090
<i>to pull her from the challenge.</i>

1333
01:24:59,100 --> 01:25:00,260
Ah!

1334
01:25:00,430 --> 01:25:01,659
Oh, my gosh!

1335
01:25:01,660 --> 01:25:03,400
So, I'm worried about Teal.

1336
01:25:03,560 --> 01:25:05,036
Seems like it's getting
worse and worse.

1337
01:25:05,060 --> 01:25:07,660
It's troubling for me because
if she gets an eye infection,

1338
01:25:07,830 --> 01:25:10,100
or if it's something that's
gonna hurt her vision

1339
01:25:10,260 --> 01:25:12,300
