1340
01:25:12,460 --> 01:25:14,760
So hopefully we
can get her to a place

1341
01:25:14,930 --> 01:25:16,210
where she's comfortable staying.

1342
01:25:17,900 --> 01:25:19,160
I don't want her to go home.

1343
01:25:20,360 --> 01:25:22,990
I'm sorry, but I'm struggling.

1344
01:25:23,000 --> 01:25:25,400
It just, it's excruciating.

1345
01:25:27,660 --> 01:25:28,960
It's just too much!

